<title>DUBAI: SOCCER-KYRGYZSTAN BEAT SYRIA 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KYRGYZSTAN BEAT SYRIA 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyrgyzstan beat Syria 2-1</p>
<p>(halftime 0-0) in their World Cup Asian zone group two soccer</p>
<p>qualifier in Tehran on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Kyrgyzstan - Kanad Sardarov 77, Sergei Kotsov 90</p>
<p>Syria - Nihad al-Boushi 85</p>
<p>    Standings     P   W  D  L  F   A  PTS</p>
<p> Iran		 3   3  0  0  25  0   9</p>
<p> Kyrgyzstan	 3   2  0  1   5  8   6</p>
<p> Syria		3   1  0  2  13  3   3</p>
<p> Maldives	   3   0  0  3   0 32   0</p>
</text>
